/* 四个新半日节令 × 5段 + 1个按日期窗口门控的Hub = 21段（3/21 春分染彩集、6/24 仲夏潮歌会、9/29 秋鹅烘焙集、12/6 圣尼古拉暖靴集） */
:: MP Town Festivals 4 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<set _m to Time.date.month>><<set _d to Time.date.day>>
高街布告栏侧下方的木槽第二格挂着四枚镌刻四时半日集期的黄铜副牌：三月二十一日的春分染彩集、六月二十四日的仲夏潮歌会、九月二十九日的秋鹅烘焙集，以及十二月六日的圣尼古拉暖靴集。
<<if not ((_m is 3 and _d gte 18 and _d lte 24) or (_m is 6 and _d gte 21 and _d lte 27) or (_m is 9 and _d gte 26) or (_m is 10 and _d lte 2) or (_m is 12 and _d gte 3 and _d lte 9))>>
	铜牌背面尚未到下一场半日节令的集期，最近的一场还要再等些日子。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回上一排节令铜牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 3 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if _m is 3 and _d gte 18 and _d lte 24>>
	<<shopicon>><<link [[春分染彩集：高街茜草染缸 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _m is 6 and _d gte 21 and _d lte 27>>
	<<beachicon>><<link [[仲夏潮歌会：浅滩浮木篝火 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (_m is 9 and _d gte 26) or (_m is 10 and _d lte 2)>>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[秋鹅烘焙集：丰收街果木砖炉 (0:04)|MP Festival Michaelmas 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _m is 12 and _d gte 3 and _d lte 9>>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[暖靴集：孤儿院门廊挂袜 (0:04)|MP Festival Warmboot 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Festival SpringDye 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
高街裁缝铺外的青石小院支起了三口紫铜染缸，茜草根与栀子果在沸水里翻滚出明艳的赤金汤色。老染匠正招手请路人帮忙搅动染棒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回节令水牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="fest-springdye-1">
<<tendingicon>><<link "执长木棒顺时针匀力搅染缸 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-1">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>
	染汤色泽透亮均匀，老染匠笑眯眯地递给你一条刚染好的茜草红丝帕。<span class="green">你帮染坊稳住了头缸春色。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向丝绸扎染长桌 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	滚烫染汤溅出一滴落在鞋尖上，热气熏得你鼻尖冒汗。<span class="red">热气扑面，鞋尖沾上了一点红汁。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[擦干手心汗水再试 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "添干柴稳住汤色温度 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_festival_springdye_1_alt"] to 1>>
	你找准受力支点稳稳使力，手头动作一气呵成。<span class="green">事情办得干净利落，没有留下半点疏漏。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向丝绸扎染长桌 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你发力时脚下微滑，手腕偏了半寸没能吃上劲。<span class="red">虎口隐隐发麻，只得先收手缓一口气。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准卡槽位置再试 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Festival SpringDye 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
染坊廊下的长木桌上铺满洁白生丝帕，莫奈正教几个学徒用麻线扎出云纹与蝴蝶花结，准备浸入靛蓝冷染缸。
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if $mpClues["mp_festival_springdye_1_alt"]>><span class="teal">结合先前留心记下的蛛丝马迹，你对眼前的局势更多了几分把握。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回节令水牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="fest-springdye-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "用细麻线扎紧四角蝶翼花结 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-2">>
<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>
	解开麻线后蓝白蝶纹栩栩如生，莫奈赞许地朝你颔首。<span class="green">你扎染出了全场最灵动的蝶翼花帕。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去竹竿架晾晒彩幡 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	麻线打结略松，靛蓝染汁渗进了留白处，花纹晕成了一团。<span class="red">麻线松脱导致染汁渗入留白。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放轻手腕力道再试 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "按图谱排好渐变浸染次序 (0:08)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-2">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_festival_springdye_2_alt"] to 1>>
	你对照莫奈的染谱按浅蓝、靛青、深紫排好浸缸时长，挂起丝帕时过渡如水墨晕染。<span class="green">莫奈笑着夸你对色彩层次极有灵气。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去竹竿架晾晒彩幡 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
冷染缸边缘湿滑，你提帕出缸时滴落的染液溅脏了旁边待染的白纱。<span class="red">你连忙拿清水抢洗，忙出一头热汗。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[垫稳脚下重心再试 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Festival SpringDye 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
院心高高架起的晾布竹竿上挂满五彩春幡，一阵春风吹来，最高处那幅金线彩绸缠在了竹梢枝杈上。
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if $mpClues["mp_festival_springdye_2_alt"]>><span class="teal">结合先前留心记下的蛛丝马迹，你对眼前的局势更多了几分把握。</span><</if>>
