	<<walkicon>><<link [[参加街心彩缕评比 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	木凳在青石板上晃了一下，你扶住晾衣架才站稳，手心擦破一点皮。<span class="red">木凳摇晃擦红了你的掌心。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[凑近微光看清再试 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拉动竹架引绳顺风解开绸 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_festival_springdye_3_alt"] to 1>>
	<span class="green">周围的街坊纷纷向你投来赞许的目光。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[参加街心彩缕评比 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">衣袖沾上了些许沫渍，好在管事并未责怪。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着纹理方向再试 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Festival SpringDye 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
午后阳光最暖时，染匠们把各色丝缕挂在街心花架下请路人品评，还要给孤儿院的孩子们分赠辟邪五色线。
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if $mpClues["mp_festival_springdye_3_alt"]>><span class="teal">结合先前留心记下的蛛丝马迹，你对眼前的局势更多了几分把握。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回节令水牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="fest-springdye-4">
<<tendingicon>><<link "给孩子们系五色丝缕 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-4">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>
	孩子们欢天喜地地围着你转，几位外地游客也大方地投下了赞赏银币。<span class="green">热闹的评比席间充满了欢声笑语。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收拢染架领取春分红封 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	人流拥挤中有人踩了你的脚背一下，五色线也乱成了一团。<span class="red">人群拥挤让你脚背被踩得生疼。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[活动酸麻手指再试 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "向游客讲解草木春染古法 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-4">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_festival_springdye_4_alt"] to 1>>
	你顺着器物纹理巧施寸劲，原本卡滞的关窍应声松开。<span class="green">你将内里藏着的收获稳稳纳入怀中。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收拢染架领取春分红封 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冷不防一阵穿堂风吹来，迷了眼角也打乱了手头节奏。<span class="red">指尖在边缘滑脱，你只好先退开半步。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[避开湿滑边角再试 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Festival SpringDye 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
夕阳西下，春分染彩集接近尾声。老染匠把晒干的头等茜草丝帕与一份节令工钱封进红纸袋递到你手里。<span class="green">你在春分染彩集度过了充实而温暖的半日时光。</span>
<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) lte 0>>
	<span class="teal">染彩集几道工序都出了岔子，管事只递给你一杯热茶暖身。</span>
<<elseif window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_springdye_reward")>>
	<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) gte 4>>
		<<money 650>><span class="gold">你圆满完成了染彩集四道工序，收下 £6.50 全勤红封。</span>
	<<else>>
		<<money 350>><span class="gold">你帮衬了染彩集部分工序，收下 £3.50 帮工红封。</span>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	染彩集红封已经拆过，只剩淡淡的纸香。
<</if>>
<<stress -6>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if $mpClues["mp_festival_springdye_4_alt"]>><span class="teal">结合先前留心记下的蛛丝马迹，你对眼前的局势更多了几分把握。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好春分丝帕与工钱返程 (0:04)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Tidesong 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
仲夏傍晚的海滩上堆起了干燥的浮木篝火堆，海风带着微咸暖意，渔民们正忙着在防风槽里淋松脂助燃。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回节令水牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="fest-tidesong-1">
<<tendingicon>><<link "按风向垒高浮木留出通风口 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-tidesong-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>
	橘红色的篝火腾空而起照亮浅滩，老水手递给你一串烤得滋滋冒油的扇贝。<span class="green">海滩篝火熊熊燃起映红了暮色。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去木棚下串贝壳风铃 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海风倒卷吹来一团浓烟，呛得你连咳数声，眼角直泛泪花。<span class="red">逆风浓烟呛得你嗓子发痒。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[听准机括声响再试 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "举火把点燃迎风侧松脂枝 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-tidesong-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_festival_tidesong_1_alt"] to 1>>
	你屏息听准周遭动静，趁着空档将手头之事妥善办完。<span class="green">整套手法行云流水，令人暗暗称奇。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去木棚下串贝壳风铃 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	内里的阻力比看上去沉得多，你试着扳动时震落了一层浮灰。<span class="red">为防弄出太大声响，你先行撤手暂退。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

